{"title":"2021 CMC 12A Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2021 CMC 12A Problems\"> 2021 CMC 12A #7</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_10A_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CMC 10A Problems (page does not exist)\"> 2021 CMC 10A #9</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It is known that every positive integer can be represented as the sum of at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> squares. What is the sum of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> smallest integers which cannot be represented as the sum of fewer than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> squares?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/d/31dba9b989f511666c5f27f5232b539eb7a7a00e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 22\\qquad\\textbf{(B) } 23\\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 24\\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 25\\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 26\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"434\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/1/0719899691095eb5d25bfb114225c5535ef98f30.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 1 &amp;= 1^2 \\\\ 2 &amp;= 1^2 + 1^2 \\\\ 3 &amp;= 1^2 + 1^2 + 1^2 \\\\ 4 &amp;= 2^2 \\\\ 5 &amp;= 1^2 + 2^2 \\\\ 6 &amp;= 1^2 + 1^2 + 2^2 \\\\ 7 \\\\ 8 &amp;= 2^2 + 2^2 \\\\ 9 &amp;= 3^2 \\\\ 10 &amp;= 1^2 + 3^2 \\\\ 11 &amp;= 1^2 + 1^2 + 3^2 \\\\ 12 &amp;= 2^2 + 2^2 + 2^2 \\\\ 13 &amp;= 2^2 + 3^2 \\\\ 14 &amp;= 1^2 + 2^2 + 3^2 \\\\ 15 \\\\ \\end{align*}\" width=\"133\" height=\"397\" />\n</p><p>We cannot find a solution in fewer than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> squares for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/5/475d92c03c424fdfe4af2e338c86bb7012f980bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7+15=\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } 22}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"139\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A\" title=\"2021 CMC 12A\">2021 CMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2021 CMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CMC 12A Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=2021\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2021 CMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CMC 12A Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CMC 12A Problems/Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2021 CMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CMC 12A Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2021 CMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" c